### USERS: login   (po odpowiedzi skopiuj token do @token u góry)
POST {{users}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":"a@a.pl", "password":"Test1234!" }

### BOOKS: add (JWT)
POST {{books}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "title":"Clean Code", "author":"Robert C. Martin", "year":2008 }

### BOOKS: list
GET {{books}}/books

### BOOKS: get by id
GET {{books}}/books/1

### ORDERS: create (JWT)
POST {{orders}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "userId":1, "bookId":1, "quantity":2 }

### ORDERS: list for user (JWT)
GET {{orders}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### BOOKS: delete (JWT)
DELETE {{books}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ORDERS: patch (JWT)
PATCH {{orders}}/orders/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "quantity":3 }

### ORDERS: delete (JWT)
DELETE {{orders}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
